  "estimatedLength": "45 minutes",
  "objectives": [
    "Identify the structural components of DNA and how they assemble into the double helix.",
    "Apply complementary base-pairing rules and explain their hydrogen-bonding basis.",
    "Describe the antiparallel orientation and 5'-to-3' directionality of DNA strands.",
    "Trace the action of enzymes at the replication fork.",
    "Explain the asymmetry of leading and lagging strand synthesis.",
    "Articulate why DNA replication is semiconservative."
